+    `_is_bind_name` accepts, and also exactly one pair of brackets around the whole IPv6 address (`[::1` and `::1]` can
+    never bind), and a letter or digit in every part of a name (`-`, `_` and `a.-.b` can never be a name). `Config`
+    itself keeps the looser check, so that `public_bind_problem` still calls a half-bracketed text public."""
+    if not _is_bind_name(name):
